#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Patch the official Claude Code Discord channel plugin (v0.0.4) for long-running agent bots. Idempotent; loud
when it cannot.

    patch-plugin                  patch the installed plugin (from ~/.claude/plugins/installed_plugins.json)
    patch-plugin --check          exit 1 if any patch is missing; change nothing
    patch-plugin --file <path>    patch that server.ts instead (how plugin/server.ts in this repo is built)

Each patch is a list of exact (old, new) edits. A patch whose anchors no longer match upstream exactly once is
reported by name and nothing is half-applied. A plugin update installs into a new version directory, unpatched:
run this again (at every start of your agent, for example). See README.md for what each patch does.
"""
